%C - Serial driver for i.MX UARTs

%C [options] [port[,irq]] &
%C specific options:
 -t number    Set receive FIFO trigger level ( 0 - 32; default 24)
 -T number    Set number of characters to send to transmit FIFO
                                             ( 2 - 32; default 32)

Examples:
# Disable HW and SW flow control for an UART device with base address on 0x30890000 and IRQ 59
# and enabled edited mode - useful for a debug port.
%C -e -F -S -u 1 0x30890000,59
